OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors urge rethink of
OL,4,AMerseyrail e-bike ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have backed a motion to
OL,7,Fcall on Merseyrail to reverse its
OL,8,Fdecision to ban non-folding e-bikes on
OL,9,Ftrains and at stations.
OL,11,FLiverpool City Council's Green Party
OL,12,Ftabled a motion saying the announcement
OL,13,Fhad been made without consulting local
OL,14,Factive travel or disability groups.
OL,16,FThe motion has cross-party support,
OL,17,Fmeaning all political groups on the
OL,18,Fauthority oppose the ban. It is due to
OL,19,Fcome into force in January.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
