OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors urge rethink of
OL,4,AMerseyrail e-bike ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision has attracted criticism,
OL,7,Fincluding a protest organised by
OL,8,FCycling UK earlier this month.
OL,9,FMerseyrail has so far stood by the
OL,10,Fmove, citing concerns about the fire
OL,11,Frisk posed by e-bike batteries. The BBC
OL,12,Fhas approached Merseyrail for comment.
